#: ../../source/architecture.md:68
msgid "Runtime Dependencies"
msgstr "Dépendances Runtime"

#: ../../source/architecture.md:70
msgid ""
"Ketu is a **pure NumPy library at runtime**. The only runtime dependency "
"is NumPy."
msgstr ""
"Ketu est une **bibliothèque Pure NumPy au runtime**. La seule dépendance "
"runtime est NumPy."

#: ../../source/architecture.md:72
msgid ""
"`pyswisseph` is used **only** in the offline build tool "
"(`tools/gen_chiron_coeffs.py`) to generate the Chiron Chebyshev "
"coefficients. It is never imported at runtime, which maintains AGPL "
"isolation."
msgstr ""
"`pyswisseph` est utilisé **uniquement** dans l'outil de build hors-ligne "
"(`tools/gen_chiron_coeffs.py`) pour générer les Coefficients de Chebyshev"
" de Chiron. Il n'est jamais importé au runtime, ce qui maintient "
"l'isolation AGPL."

