msgstr "Séparation des préoccupations"

#: ../../source/architecture.md:201
msgid ""
"`ephemeris/`: pure astronomical calculations (no astrological "
"interpretation)"
msgstr ""
"`ephemeris/` : calculs astronomiques purs (sans interprétation "
"astrologique)"

