msgstr "`display.py` : interface utilisateur uniquement"

#: ../../source/architecture.md:204
msgid "Subpackages: each feature area is self-contained"
msgstr "Sous-paquets : chaque domaine fonctionnel est autonome"

#: ../../source/architecture.md:206
msgid "Vectorization First"
msgstr "Vectorisation en premier"

#: ../../source/architecture.md:208
msgid ""
"All core functions support both scalar and array inputs via NumPy "
"broadcasting."
msgstr ""
"Toutes les fonctions principales supportent entrées scalaires et tableaux"
" via broadcasting NumPy."

#: ../../source/architecture.md:210
msgid "No Global State"
msgstr "Pas d'état global"

#: ../../source/architecture.md:212
msgid ""
"All functions are pure — same inputs always produce same outputs. LRU "
"cache is the only shared state (clearable via "
"`body_properties.cache_clear()`)."
msgstr ""
"Toutes les fonctions sont pures — mêmes entrées produisent toujours mêmes"
" sorties. Le Cache LRU est le seul état partagé (effaçable via "
"`body_properties.cache_clear()`)."

#: ../../source/architecture.md:214
msgid "Pure NumPy Runtime"
msgstr "Runtime Pure NumPy"

#: ../../source/architecture.md:216
msgid ""
"Only NumPy is imported at runtime. pyswisseph is a test/build-only "
